\f0\b\fs24 OSX Power Additions Lite
\f1\b0  is a set of applescript utilities for Mac OS X.\
It includes:\

\f0\b Shell
\f1\b0 : scripting addition that enable you to send commands directly to the unix shell.\

\f0\b Get My Pid
\f1\b0 : scripting addition that enable you to get the pid of the current script/process.\
\
What's new from AEShell 1.0b2:\
- The Shell command now returns the stderr (if an error occurs)\
- some new scripts: 
\f2 GetMyPID.app, GetMyPID.script, 
\f3 Open Terminal and StdErr
